      "The compact Web authority panel is 146.21875x537 while Lynx-for-Web is 148x500. Content, tail visibility, containment, and interaction converge, but section chrome and glass/material pixels are not exact."
    ],
    "evidenceBoundary": "One immutable Browser snapshot is used for dark narrow Files, light narrow Files, wide dark Files, 1024 ownership, and compact controls. Exact Native uses a disposable generated snapshot, the final production bundle, explicit 1024x820 dark viewport, measured DevTool touch, main transport advancement, zero renderer errors, and disposed isolated state. No tracked screenshots are added."
